# The theorems of CheckAssumptions.v that may use axioms, one per line:
#   <full name>: <axiom> <axiom> ...
# Every other theorem must be "Closed under the global context".
# Parser.loc is the parser's abstract type of source positions, instantiated by the driver.
Mctt.Entrypoint.main_sound: Mctt.Frontend.Parser.loc
Mctt.Entrypoint.main_complete: Mctt.Frontend.Parser.loc
Mctt.Entrypoint.main_rep: Mctt.Frontend.Parser.loc

# The PENDING admits: lemmas admitted until their milestone, one per line,
#   <full name>: <milestone> <what proves it>
# Any checked theorem may use them; every run names the ones used, so that
# they never become silent.  Any other unexpected assumption still fails.
[PENDING]
Mctt.Core.Soundness.soundness: M2 the gluing model for the Prop core
Mctt.Core.Soundness.soundness_upto_proofs: M2 the gluing model for the Prop core
Mctt.Core.Soundness.soundness_lvl_well_scoped: M2 the gluing of levels
Mctt.Core.Consequences.Consistency.typ_ind_shape: M2 the gluing of the inductive type
Mctt.Core.Consequences.Consistency.typ_record_shape: M2 the gluing of the record type
Mctt.Core.Consequences.Consistency.consistency: M3 from the model
Mctt.Core.Consequences.Consistency.consistency_False: M3 from the model
Mctt.Core.Consequences.Consistency.closed_False_proof_mentions_global: M3 the gluing model and global-context strengthening
